INSTALL /v0.1.2/demos/javascript/Dollyfile-javascript b94472008ade0827cbd55cf247b4e0bed700630f37f57a9a7cc06b90ac2ebd6d
INSTALL /v0.1.2/demos/pi/Dollyfile-pi 19f0485b783d6a615c611ff812e5065d53af02fadb13efbf00ce68e26509c076
REQUIRES TOOL cc
REQUIRES TOOL ar
